        "rationale": "The draft's generic event envelope has no adopter and conflicts with EAVT's witness-row carrier. Its reusable byte-level integrity effect is now one profile in the upstream JSONL data service; source feeds, append traces, witness time, and semiotic meaning remain consumers' separate concerns.",
